on SettingsPYTHONUNBUFFERED=1LOG_LEVEL=INFODEBUG=false# =============================================================================# QUICK START INSTRUCTIONS# =============================================================================# 1. Copy this template:#    cp .env.example .env## 2. Edit .env with your actual API keys## 3. Start the complete stack:#    docker-compose up --build## 4. Verify installation:#    docker-compose logs agentic-app## 5. Access services:#    - RedisInsight UI: http://localhost:8001#    - Application API: http://localhost:8000## =============================================================================# API KEY SOURCES# =============================================================================# OpenAI: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys# Anthropic: https://console.anthropic.com/# Google Cloud: https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/serviceaccounts# Pinecone: https://app.pinecone.io/# Mistral AI: https://console.mistral.ai/# Cohere: https://dashboard.cohere.com/api-keys# Groq: https://console.groq.com/keys# Together AI: https://api.together.xyz/settings/api-keys# Fireworks AI: https://fireworks.ai/account/api-keys